    "body": "You can use Firefox’s **View source** to confirm Firefox’s (spec-conforming) HTML parser flags an error:\n1. Open view-source:https://people.w3.org/mike/tests/svg-script.html in Firefox\n2. Observe that in line 12 the U+003C less-than sign is red.\n3. Hover over the red U+003C less-than sign in line 12 and observe that Firefox shows the following error message:\n   \n   ```\n   Bad character “ ” after “<”. Probable cause: Unescaped “<”. Try escaping it as “&lt;”\n   ```\n\nSee also https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1271099\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
