    "body": "```\n<svg width='320px' height='320px'>\n  <script type='text/javascript'>\n    if (1<foo) a = 0;\n  </script>\n</svg>\n```\n\n..creates an element \"foo)\".\n\nIt's bad ergonomics, but it's the same as in XML, and the solution is also the same; use `<![CDATA[` ... `]]>`. Maybe you can special-case the message in v.nu for SVG script/style?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
